.lookcheck/
agents/

# the raw Sprout Lands packs (Cup Nooble): never commit them, their license forbids redistributing the pack itself.
# The sheets the game uses (web/assets/, nexel_worlds/art.py FILES) are committed: the license allows that.
assets_pack/
*.zip
.venv*/
# pictures made from the pack by the design prototypes and the music page: same rule
design/enemies/site/game/
design/enemies/site/refs.png
design/enemies/site/horizon/*.png
design/enemies/site/sheets/robot_*.png
design/enemies/site/sheets/race_*.png
design/enemies/site/sheets/robots_look.png
music/site/chick.png
# the pack's fonts (the game draws its own: sprout-pixel.ttf, tools/build_font.py)
src/nexel_worlds/web/assets/font*.ttf
# long screen recordings for the devlog: kept out of git (large)
tools/pages/*.mp4
tools/pages/*.gif
